<title>CANADA: TENNIS-QUEBEC CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUEBEC CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>QUEBEC CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $164,250</p>
<p>Bell Challenge women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>5-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat 1-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-0 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>2-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Jolene Watanabe (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Tami Whitlinger-Jones (U.S.) beat 4-Kimberly Po (U.S.) 1-6</p>
<p>6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat 6-Florencia Labat (Argentina) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
